      "text": "Hardion L, Verlaque R, Callmander M W, Vila B, carolina (2012). Arundo micrantha Lam. (Poaceae), the correct name for Arundo mauritanica Desf. and Arundo mediterranea Danin. Plazi.org taxonomic treatments database. Checklist dataset https://doi.org/10.15553/c2012v671a11 accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-09-15.",
